## Proposed Architecture Enhancement

### New Backend Services

#### 1. Market Analytics Service (`backend/src/analytics/`)
```
- market-analyzer.ts: Calculate advanced metrics (volatility, momentum, correlation)
- comparative-analyzer.ts: Compare markets, time periods, platforms
- historical-aggregator.ts: Roll up historical data into useful summaries
- trend-detector.ts: Identify emerging trends using statistical methods
```

#### 2. Data Aggregation Layer (`backend/src/aggregation/`)
```
- time-series-aggregator.ts: OHLCV data from multiple sources
- category-aggregator.ts: Group markets by topic/category
- platform-aggregator.ts: Combine Polymarket + Kalshi data
- cache-manager.ts: Intelligent caching for expensive computations
```

#### 3. Enhanced Database Schema
**New Tables:**
- `price_history`: OHLCV data (open, high, low, close, volume)
- `market_metrics`: Pre-calculated metrics (volatility, momentum, spread)
- `market_categories`: Tag-based categorization
- `market_correlations`: Cross-market relationships
- `platform_stats`: Platform-wide aggregates
- `user_watchlists`: Custom market tracking
- `custom_portfolios`: Simulated position tracking

#### 4. New API Endpoints
```
GET  /api/analytics/market/:id/metrics          # All metrics for one market
GET  /api/analytics/market/:id/compare/:otherId # Compare two markets
GET  /api/analytics/categories                   # Market categories with stats
GET  /api/analytics/category/:tag/performance   # Category-level metrics
GET  /api/analytics/platform/overview           # Platform-wide stats
GET  /api/analytics/correlation-matrix          # Market correlation heatmap
GET  /api/analytics/volume-distribution         # Volume by category/time
GET  /api/analytics/trader-distribution         # Trader size distribution
POST /api/portfolio/simulate                     # Run portfolio simulation
GET  /api/portfolio/:id/performance             # Track simulated portfolio
GET  /api/timeseries/:marketId                  # OHLCV with flexible intervals
GET  /api/watchlist/:userId                     # User's tracked markets
POST /api/watchlist/:userId/add                 # Add market to watchlist
```

