## Technical Debt & Maintenance

### Current Technical Debt
1. Alert system is overly complex for current needs
2. Multiple monitoring services (monitor.ts, enhanced-monitor.ts) overlap
3. Database queries not optimized (missing indexes)
4. No automated testing
5. Frontend components lack TypeScript strict mode
6. Inconsistent error handling

### Ongoing Maintenance Tasks
- Weekly: Review and tune alert thresholds
- Monthly: Audit API usage and optimize caching
- Quarterly: Database cleanup (archive old data)
- As needed: Update dependencies and security patches

### Recommended Refactoring
1. Consolidate monitoring services into single unified system
2. Add database indexes for common queries
3. Implement comprehensive error boundary in React
4. Add unit tests for analytics calculations
5. Set up CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions)

